U2, and Jamiroquai. \"tenemos las influencias en Kylie Minogue.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Music Radar Clan","episode":"Pet Shop Boys. Por qué son tan importantes?","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9amZ-BTYt4E"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Euro Disco Influence","body":"Her late 80s British pop sound was influenced by the Euro Disco scene, which was predominantly based in Italy and Germany. \"That scene later influenced a lot of late 80s British pop like Rick Astley and Connie Menog.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"The Roots of New Wave through Techno-Pop","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1KF5MwJVYng"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Iconic Australian Artist","body":"Kylie Minogue is often the first artist that comes to mind when people think about Australian music, highlighting her significant recognition. \"cuando tú piensas en australia pues evidentemente lo primero que piensas es en Kylie Minogue.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Music Radar Clan","episode":"The Holidays - El perfecto ejemplo de buena banda australiana","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=89RG5lHTyOU"}]}],"awards":[{"kind":"award","title":"Gold Logie Award for Most Popular Personality on Australian Television (1988) — Neighbours","body":"Won.","year":1988,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Wikidata","episode":null,"url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q16191288"}]},{"kind":"award","title":"Centenary Medal (2001)","body":"Won.","year":2001,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Wikidata","episode":null,"url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q2393205"}]},{"kind":"award","title":"BRIT Award for International Female Solo Artist (2002)","body":"Won.","year":2002,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Wikidata","episode":null,"url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q16985325"}]},{"kind":"award","title":"BRIT Award for International Female Solo Artist (2008)","body":"Won.","year":2008,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Wiki